<title>USA: Fun Tyme plans 3-for-1 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Fun Tyme plans 3-for-1 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fun Tyme Concepts Inc said on Tuesday its board has authorized a one-for-three reverse stock split, in an attempt to meet listing requirements for the Nasdaq SmallCap Stock Market.</p>
<p>The company said it will attempt to comply with the Nasdaq SmallCap Stock Market's $1 minimum bid price for its stock by this reverse split.</p>
<p>There is no guarantee the company will continue to be listed on the market, the company said.</p>
</text>
